# Keep host build output out of the build context. Every Dockerfile here
# restores and builds inside the image, so anything below is at best dead
# weight and at worst clobbers what the container installed -- the
# ManagementWeb image copies its project directory after `npm ci`, so a
# developer's local node_modules would overwrite the container's.

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/

# VCS and tooling
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Test and runtime output
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/*.log
